        <mxCell id="c154" value="A failed file never stops the import: read errors, archive limits (1 GiB per entry, 4 GiB per archive), empty or binary files, no matching importer, no events and contained panics (a crashed plugin process too) become an &lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;UnrecognizedFile&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; with its reason. Cancelled files are listed as “Not imported”. Plugin importers run in their own sandboxed process behind &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;Guarded*&lt;/span&gt; adapters (failures counted, quarantined after 3); readers keep working while an import runs." style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1B2130;fontSize=11;shape=note;size=12;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#8A93A6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2130;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="2442" width="1120" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
